Route2_Text_RouteSign::
    .string "ROUTE 2\n"
    .string "VIRIDIAN CITY - PEWTER CITY$"

Route2_Text_DiglettsCave::
    .string "DIGLETT'S CAVE$"

Route2_Text_GarretIntro::
	.string "BUG POKéMON drift out from\n"
	.string "VIRIDIAN FOREST onto this road.\p"
	.string "I watch the grass for movement!$"

Route2_Text_GarretDefeat::
	.string "You spotted my strategy!$"

Route2_Text_GarretPostBattle::
	.string "ROUTE 2 is perfect for bug study.\p"
	.string "Forest shade on one side,\n"
	.string "open grass on the other.$"

Route2_Text_JonahIntro::
	.string "The forest gate is close.\p"
	.string "If you can handle my bugs, you can\n"
	.string "handle the path ahead!$"

Route2_Text_JonahDefeat::
	.string "My bugs lost their footing!$"

Route2_Text_JonahPostBattle::
	.string "The trees make ROUTE 2 feel calm,\n"
	.string "but the grass is always busy.$"

Route2_Text_ShaneIntro::
	.string "I set camp where the road bends\n"
	.string "between VIRIDIAN and PEWTER.\p"
	.string "Every traveler passes this shade!$"

Route2_Text_ShaneRematchIntro::
	.string "Back through ROUTE 2?\p"
	.string "Then let's see what the forest road\n"
	.string "has taught you!$"

Route2_Text_ShaneDefeat::
	.string "You know the trail well!$"

Route2_Text_ShanePostBattle::
	.string "A shaded route keeps your team\n"
	.string "fresh.\p"
	.string "That's why I like camping here.$"

Route2_Text_NancyIntro::
	.string "I picked this spot for lunch.\p"
	.string "You can hear the forest without\n"
	.string "stepping under the trees.$"

Route2_Text_NancyRematchIntro::
	.string "I've had another picnic and another\n"
	.string "training session.\p"
	.string "Ready for both?$"

Route2_Text_NancyDefeat::
	.string "That was a lively picnic!$"

Route2_Text_NancyPostBattle::
	.string "ROUTE 2 is long, but the forest\n"
	.string "breaks it into little resting spots.$"

Route2_Text_OrinIntro::
	.string "The best bugs are just outside\n"
	.string "the forest, where they warm up\l"
	.string "in the grass!$"

Route2_Text_OrinDefeat::
	.string "They cooled off too fast!$"

Route2_Text_OrinPostBattle::
	.string "Morning light hits the route before\n"
	.string "it reaches the deep forest.\p"
	.string "BUG POKéMON notice that.$"

Route2_Text_RowanIntro::
	.string "A good forest route gives you\n"
	.string "cover, quiet, and a clear path.\p"
	.string "Let me test your trail sense!$"

Route2_Text_RowanDefeat::
	.string "You kept your bearings!$"

Route2_Text_RowanPostBattle::
	.string "Keep one eye on the grass and one\n"
	.string "eye on the treeline.\p"
	.string "That's forest-route travel.$"

Route2_Text_LyraIntro::
	.string "I brought snacks for the forest\n"
	.string "edge.\p"
	.string "Battles make them taste better!$"

Route2_Text_LyraDefeat::
	.string "I need a snack break!$"

Route2_Text_LyraPostBattle::
	.string "The forest entrance is a good place\n"
	.string "to rest before heading north.$"

Route2_Text_MiloIntro::
	.string "POKéMON behave differently where\n"
	.string "woods meet open road.\p"
	.string "I'm studying that boundary.$"

Route2_Text_MiloDefeat::
	.string "That's worth recording!$"

Route2_Text_MiloPostBattle::
	.string "Forest POKéMON are less shy near\n"
	.string "ROUTE 2 once they know the path is\l"
	.string "safe.$"

Route2_Text_EllisIntro::
	.string "Inside the forest is obvious.\p"
	.string "The real bug secrets are here,\n"
	.string "right at the edge!$"

Route2_Text_EllisDefeat::
	.string "My secret spot failed me!$"

Route2_Text_EllisPostBattle::
	.string "Bugs cross from bark to grass and\n"
	.string "back again.\p"
	.string "That's why I watch the edge.$"

Route2_Text_IvyIntro::
	.string "I patrol ROUTE 2 because it links\n"
	.string "VIRIDIAN, PEWTER, and the forest.\p"
	.string "Show me you can travel safely!$"

Route2_Text_IvyDefeat::
	.string "You travel with care.$"

Route2_Text_IvyPostBattle::
	.string "A route this useful needs looking\n"
	.string "after.\p"
	.string "Forest paths can change quickly.$"
